sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as B2B / Retail Customer
    participant Client as React 19 Client UI
    participant AcceptJS as Authorize.Net Accept.js
    participant ServerAction as Next.js API (/api/checkout)
    participant Prisma as Core POS DB (Prisma Accelerate)
    participant AuthNet as Authorize.Net Gateway
    participant HomePOS as In-House POS REST API

    Customer->>Client: Submit Card Details (PAN, CVV, Exp)
    Client->>AcceptJS: dispatchData(secureData)
    AcceptJS-->>Client: opaqueData (nonce: tokenValue)
    Note over Client,AcceptJS: PCI-DSS Zero-Card-Data Exposure on Server

    Client->>ServerAction: POST /api/checkout (opaqueData, amount)
    ServerAction->>Prisma: Revalidate Cart Total & Line VAT (computeCart)
    Prisma-->>ServerAction: Current Stock & Total Validated
    ServerAction->>ServerAction: Enforce Anti-Tampering (|clientAmount - expectedAmount| <= 0.01)

    ServerAction->>AuthNet: Step 1: createTransactionRequest (AUTHONLYTRANSACTION)
    alt Gateway Declined / Network Failure
        AuthNet-->>ServerAction: 400 Error (Declined)
        ServerAction-->>Client: Payment Authorization Failed
    else Authorization Approved (transId granted)
        AuthNet-->>ServerAction: 200 OK: transId, authCode

        ServerAction->>HomePOS: Step 2: POST /Voucher/order (insertOrderThroughApi)
        alt POS Voucher Creation Fails / Timeout
            HomePOS-->>ServerAction: Error 500 / Timeout
            ServerAction->>AuthNet: Compensating Void: voidTransactionRequest(transId)
            AuthNet-->>ServerAction: Void Confirmed (Funds Released)
            ServerAction-->>Client: 500 Error (POS Unavailable, Card Released)
        else POS Voucher Succeeds
            HomePOS-->>ServerAction: 200 OK (voucherId generated)

            ServerAction->>AuthNet: Step 3: PRIORAUTHCAPTURETRANSACTION(transId)
            alt Card Capture Declined / Network Error
                AuthNet-->>ServerAction: Capture Error
                ServerAction->>HomePOS: Compensating Rollback: DELETE /Voucher/order/{id}
                ServerAction->>AuthNet: Compensating Void: voidTransactionRequest(transId)
                ServerAction-->>Client: 502 Error (Capture Failed, Order Cancelled)
            else Capture Confirmed
                AuthNet-->>ServerAction: 200 OK (Capture Settled)

                ServerAction->>HomePOS: Step 4: PUT /Voucher/order/{id}/payment (updatePaymentStatus)
                alt POS Payment Ledger Update Fails
                    HomePOS-->>ServerAction: Ledger Error
                    ServerAction->>AuthNet: Compensating Void: voidTransactionRequest(captureTransId)
                    ServerAction->>HomePOS: Compensating Rollback: DELETE /Voucher/order/{id}
                    ServerAction-->>Client: 500 Error (Ledger Failure, Transaction Reversed)
                else Ledger Settled
                    HomePOS-->>ServerAction: 200 OK (Settled)
                    ServerAction-->>Client: 200 OK (Order Confirmed, Receipt Generated)
                end
            end
        end
    end
